{"id":"cdb394894320b53b","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-inner2-generic-extension-code.md","title":"ZFC Inner2 Generic Extension Code","display":"df-zfc-inner2-generic-extension-code — ZFC Inner2 Generic Extension Code","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-inner2-generic-extension-code","aliases":["58-df-zfc-inner2-generic-extension-code"],"display":"df-zfc-inner2-generic-extension-code — ZFC Inner2 Generic Extension Code","depends_on":["[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-generic]]","[[58-df-zfc-inner2-transitive-model]]","[[58-df-zfc-forcing-name]]","[[58-df-zfc-forcing-name-evaluation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-inner2-generic-extension-code"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-inner2-generic-extension-code</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-inner2-generic-extension-code — ZFC Inner2 Generic Extension Code"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"545853811ce0a4b6\" href=\"?note=545853811ce0a4b6\" title=\"58-df-generic\">58-df-generic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b8a669eb1f18f3f5\" href=\"?note=b8a669eb1f18f3f5\" title=\"58-df-zfc-inner2-transitive-model\">58-df-zfc-inner2-transitive-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4e84e795929a8b98\" href=\"?note=4e84e795929a8b98\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing-name\">58-df-zfc-forcing-name</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3a9a09c4855ab3f8\" href=\"?note=3a9a09c4855ab3f8\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing-name-evaluation\">58-df-zfc-forcing-name-evaluation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N,M,G,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal N_{M,\\mathbb P}\\in V\">\\(N,M,G,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal N_{M,\\mathbb P}\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ran}:V\\to V\">\\(\\operatorname{ran}:V\\to V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInner2TransitiveModel}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInner2TransitiveModel}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b8a669eb1f18f3f5\" href=\"?note=b8a669eb1f18f3f5\" title=\"58-df-zfc-inner2-transitive-model\">58-df-zfc-inner2-transitive-model</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Generic}(G,\\mathbb P,M)\">\\(\\mathrm{Generic}(G,\\mathbb P,M)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"545853811ce0a4b6\" href=\"?note=545853811ce0a4b6\" title=\"58-df-generic\">58-df-generic</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingName}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingName}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingNameEvaluation}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingNameEvaluation}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"4e84e795929a8b98\" href=\"?note=4e84e795929a8b98\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing-name\">58-df-zfc-forcing-name</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"3a9a09c4855ab3f8\" href=\"?note=3a9a09c4855ab3f8\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing-name-evaluation\">58-df-zfc-forcing-name-evaluation</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInner2GenericExtensionCode}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInner2GenericExtensionCode}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner2\\text{-}ground\\text{-}model\\text{-}names}\\vdash\n\\mathcal N_{M,\\mathbb P}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\tau\\in M:\\mathrm{ZfcForcingName}_S(\\tau,\\mathbb P)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner2\\text{-}ground\\text{-}model\\text{-}names}\\vdash\n\\mathcal N_{M,\\mathbb P}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\tau\\in M:\\mathrm{ZfcForcingName}_S(\\tau,\\mathbb P)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner2\\text{-}generic\\text{-}extension\\text{-}code}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcInner2GenericExtensionCode}_S(N,M,G,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad \\mathrm{ZfcInner2TransitiveModel}_S(M)\n\\land\\mathbb P\\in M\\land G\\subseteq\\mathbb P\n\\land\\mathrm{Generic}(G,\\mathbb P,M)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad \\land\\exists e\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(e,\\mathcal N_{M,\\mathbb P},\\operatorname{ran}(e))\n\\land\\forall\\tau\\in\\mathcal N_{M,\\mathbb P}\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingNameEvaluation}_S(e(\\tau),\\tau,G,\\mathbb P)\n\\land N=\\operatorname{ran}(e)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner2\\text{-}generic\\text{-}extension\\text{-}code}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcInner2GenericExtensionCode}_S(N,M,G,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad \\mathrm{ZfcInner2TransitiveModel}_S(M)\n\\land\\mathbb P\\in M\\land G\\subseteq\\mathbb P\n\\land\\mathrm{Generic}(G,\\mathbb P,M)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad \\land\\exists e\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(e,\\mathcal N_{M,\\mathbb P},\\operatorname{ran}(e))\n\\land\\forall\\tau\\in\\mathcal N_{M,\\mathbb P}\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingNameEvaluation}_S(e(\\tau),\\tau,G,\\mathbb P)\n\\land N=\\operatorname{ran}(e)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The extension is the set-coded range of the evaluation function on forcing names belonging to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>; no class comprehension or undeclared valuation operator remains.</li>\n<li>The name domain calls the exact compatibility predicate exported by <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"4e84e795929a8b98\" href=\"?note=4e84e795929a8b98\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing-name\">58-df-zfc-forcing-name</a>; the former <code>ForcingName_S</code> spelling was not defined there.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-generic","status":"resolved","id":"545853811ce0a4b6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-generic]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-inner2-transitive-model","status":"resolved","id":"b8a669eb1f18f3f5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-inner2-transitive-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing-name","status":"resolved","id":"4e84e795929a8b98","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-forcing-name]]","embed":false},{"ta